### Page 1 of 1

```text
CEREMONIAL RESOLUTION NO.   6114

ENTITLED: “A CEREMONIAL RESOLUTION IN RECOGNITION OF

THE HONORABLE ROCKY CASE

FOR HIS DEDICATION AND OUTSTANDING CONTRIBUTIONS
TO THE CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING, AND ITS RESIDENTS.”

WHEREAS, the Honorable Rocky Case has served the residents of Cheyenne as
an active and dedicated member of the Cheyenne City Council for four years; and

WHEREAS, he has conscientiously performed the duties of his office, as well as
serving as Public Services Committee Chairman and President of the City Council, and

WHEREAS, through this service he has made significant contributions to the
growth and development of this City and the welfare of its residents.

NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY
OF THE CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING, that the Honorable Rocky Case is
hereby commended for his efforts on behalf of the residents of Cheyenne and his
dedication to the community and to the Cheyenne City Council.

PRESENTED, READ AND ADOPTED this 4th Day of January, 2021.

Marian J. Orr, Mayor
ATTEST:

Kristina F. Jones, City Clerk
```
